      "text": "When the bloodsiphon dies, its body explodes in a cloudy red burst of necrotic dried blood in a 20-foot area.\n\nCreatures in range must attempt a DC 21 Reflex save save.\n\n---\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\n\nSuccess The creature takes 2d6 void damage.\n\nFailure The creature takes 4d6 void damage.\n\nCritical Failure The creature takes 6d6 void damage and is Enfeebled 2 for 1 hour."
